# Analysis outputs — generated by the second-level pipeline.
# Code (scripts, helpers, readme) is committed; data and results are not.

# Dated analysis sessions and logs
analysis_*/
run_*.log

# Intermediate/final per-comparison output CSVs (output of grab_betas + merge)
*_allchannels.csv
*_allregions.csv

# Subject lists (sensitive; match the existing convention at 04_secondlevel_group/)
*.sublist.txt

# Regenerated covariate file (sensitive: clinical/substance-use data)
select.cov.na.1D

# Group-level comparison outputs (CSVs + figures)
results_*/

# Generated reports
report.md
report.html
report_regions.md
report_regions.html

# One-off / scratch
test_output.csv

# Backups
*.bak
